This project combines selected categories from MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat
(GPL-3.0) and RussiaFancyLists (MIT), with a Happ routing profile.
The combined dataset is redistributed under GPL-3.0. Original licenses
and notices are in licenses/. Source URLs are in sources.json; each
build publishes the original fetched lists and SHA-256 hashes.

MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat:
https://github.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat

Noktomezo/RussiaFancyLists:
https://github.com/Noktomezo/RussiaFancyLists

The builder uses the official V2Ray/Xray protobuf schema via the
pinned Go module in go.mod. See upstream module licenses.
